{"id": 994332, "slug": "laundry-store-simulator", "name": "Laundry Store Simulator", "name_original": "Laundry Store Simulator", "description": "<p>Are you ready to own the world's best laundry store? Transform a small laundry shop into a laundry empire!</p><p>Discover the following features in Laundry Store Simulator: </p><p>Build a small laundry store into a thriving business empire! Upgrade your equipment, design and expand your store, hire staff, and more!</p><p>Upgrade your equipment to provide exceptional cleaning services! Invest in high-quality washing machines, dryers, ironing equipment, and even automated washing machines!</p><p>Create a stylish and inviting space to attract customers! Provide comfortable seating, warm decorations, and more funsies to welcome your customers!</p><p>Grow your laundry business by unlocking new areas and features, offering complimentary services to attract more customers!</p><p>Build a dedicated team to manage your laundry store efficiently! Hire qualified and experienced staff laundry attendants, such as, washers, dryers, and more!</p><p>Boost your profits by selling cleaning supplies and becoming a one-stop shop for laundry needs! Offer a variety of cleaning products, including detergents, fabric softeners, stain removers, and more!</p><p>Unleash your creativity by designing custom shirts for unique customers! Draw anything, print it, and watch them proudly wear your creations in style!</p><p> </p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2024-12-09", "tba": false, "updated": "2024-12-13T08:11:41", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/b83/b831944c75eff9f4672b186587a457d3.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/5aa/5aac2c37fba210ea2f5100cc62d46a23.jpg", "website": "https://akhirpekan.studio/games-laundry-simulator/", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 0, "added_by_status": null, "playtime": 0, "screensho